  "description": "Experience the charm of Great Things, a captivating display font. With its unique characters and vibrant design, this font is guaranteed to bring a bright and cheerful touch to all your designs. Great Things is a graffiti font designed for all types of professional branding projects, such as logos, comics, watermarks, posters, branding, promotions, product packaging, and more. Each letter features a graffiti-style design. This font is available in two font combinations: regular and extruded.\nFurthermore, this font is PUA-certified, meaning you’ll have easy access to a wide variety of stunning glyphs and ligatures, adding a new level of depth and dimension to its functionality.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Experience the charm of Great Things, a captivating display font. With its unique characters and vibrant design, this font is guaranteed to bring a bright and cheerful touch to all your designs. Great Things is a graffiti font designed for all types of professional branding projects, such as logos, comics, watermarks, posters, branding, promotions, product packaging, and more. Each letter features a graffiti-style design. This font is available in two font combinations: regular and extruded.<br>\nFurthermore, this font is PUA-certified, meaning you’ll have easy access to a wide variety of stunning glyphs and ligatures, adding a new level of depth and dimension to its functionality.</p>",
